  ('d7c8ed0a-3aea-4f44-b356-7414f2d3f7a8', 'ba971bfd-e5de-4d96-b596-a236cfb067f6', 'e182caac-03d4-4f21-8230-35d7f08b3e00', 'security_issue', 'info', 'GitHub Actions step uses a mutable tag or branch reference. Tags and branch names can be silently repointed by the action owner, enabling supply-chain attacks — as seen in the trivy-action and kics-github-action compromises. Pin the reference to a full 40-character commit SHA instead, e.g. `uses: actions/checkout@8ade135a41bc03ea155e62e844d188df1ea18608`.', 'GitHub Actions step uses a mutable tag or branch reference. Tags and branch names can be silently repointed by the action owner, enabling supply-chain attacks — as seen in the trivy-action and kics-github-action compromises. Pin the reference to a full 40-character commit SHA instead, e.g. `uses: actions/checkout@8ade135a41bc03ea155e62e844d188df1ea18608`.', '/var/folders/hm/p23mppcx3tbd4zg7k16dt67w0000gr/T/github-scan-q1FlZT/repo/.github/workflows/publish-style-skill.yml', 19, 9, NULL, 'yaml.github-actions.security.github-actions-mutable-action-tag.github-actions-mutable-action-tag', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CWE-1357: Reliance on Insufficiently Trustworthy Component', '["https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions#using-third-party-actions"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'open', to_timestamp(1787723453780 / 1000.0), to_timestamp(1787723453780 / 1000.0)),
