  ('35821b2c-8233-41ed-8b6d-5047021e5803', 'ba971bfd-e5de-4d96-b596-a236cfb067f6', '4a874e53-63e6-411c-bbdb-b496662e2037', 'vulnerability', 'high', 'CVE-2026-1528', 'ImpactA server can reply with a WebSocket frame using the 64-bit length form and an extremely large length. undici''s ByteParser overflows internal math, ends up in an invalid state, and throws a fatal TypeError that terminates the process.

Patches

